# Egress allowlist for the firewalled workspace variant.
# One hostname per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The firewall already permits DNS, loopback, and the built-in defaults
# (npm, PyPI, GitHub). Add any extra hosts your project needs to reach.
#
# To use: copy this file to `allowlist` (no extension) in this firewall
# directory, edit it, then start the workspace with:
#   devcontainer up --workspace-folder . --config .devcontainer/firewall/devcontainer.json

# api.anthropic.com
# your-internal-api.example.com
